        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also manufacture and supply high energy and power density Li-Metal and Li-ion cells which can be used for drones, UAM, robotics and EV applications, which are regularly improved through research powered by Molecular Universe.",
